<div class="form-field" style="max-width:420px">
    <span class="form-label" id="lbc-label">Escalation policy</span>
    <div class="listbox" role="listbox" aria-labelledby="lbc-label" aria-multiselectable="true" tabindex="0" style="--listbox-rows:6">
        <div role="option" aria-selected="true">
            <i class="ri-phone-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span class="option-text">Call the duty engineer<span class="option-hint">Rings the rota phone, then the lead after 5 minutes</span></span>
        </div>
        <div role="option" aria-selected="false">
            <i class="ri-mail-send-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span class="option-text">E-mail the team<span class="option-hint">One message to the group address, no acknowledgement</span></span>
        </div>
        <div role="option" aria-selected="true">
            <i class="ri-notification-3-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span class="option-text">Push to the on-call app<span class="option-hint">Repeats every 2 minutes until someone accepts</span></span>
        </div>
        <div role="option" aria-selected="false" aria-disabled="true">
            <i class="ri-chat-3-line" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span class="option-text">Post to the channel<span class="option-hint">Unavailable &mdash; no channel is connected</span></span>
        </div>
    </div>
    <p class="form-hint">
        A row is whatever the app writes in it. A two-line row is taller than a one-line one, so set
        <code>--listbox-rows</code> to about half the rows you want on screen &mdash; here 6 shows 3.
    </p>
</div>
